Usage:
  which-model [command]

Available Commands:
  catalog     catalog refresh and views
  pick        Pick a model for a task profile
  routes      Manage the provider route table
  schema      Print the JSON Schema for a command's --json output
  skills      Install, remove, or list agent skills
  hooks       Install, remove, or run agent dispatch hooks
  explain     Explain a previous pick
  serve       serve the usage cache over HTTP (placeholder)
  config      inspect and update which-model configuration
  version     print version information
  help        Help about any command

Flags:
      --aggregator string    scoring aggregator name (default "weighted-arithmetic-mean")
      --config string        explicit config file path
  -h, --help                 help for which-model
      --json                 emit JSON output
      --max-age duration     maximum snapshot age before a refresh is forced
      --no-color             disable colored output
      --no-usage             disable usage for this run
      --normalizer string    scoring normalizer name (default "minmax-linear")
      --offline              never touch the network
      --quiet                suppress non-essential output
      --refresh              force every refresh
      --refresh-benchmarks   force a benchmarks refresh
      --refresh-scores       force a scores refresh
      --refresh-usage        force a usage refresh
      --schema               print the resolved command's JSON schema
      --show-identity        show identity fields in output
      --text                 emit text output (inverse of --json)
      --timeout duration     per-request timeout (default 10s)
      --verbose count        increase verbosity (repeatable)

Use "which-model [command] --help" for more information about a command.
